Authentication

POST   /finsecure/public/signup
→ Register a new user 

POST   /finsecure/public/login
→ Login and get JWT token 


Company Bank Accounts 

POST   /finsecure/finance/banks
→ Add a bank  

PUT    /finsecure/finance/banks/{id}/status
→ Update bank status (WHITELISTED / BLACKLISTED) 

GET    /finsecure/finance/banks/{id}
→ Get bank by ID 

GET    /finsecure/finance/banks?page=0&size=10&status=
→ Get all banks with pagination and optional status filter 


 Company Mutual Funds 

POST   /finsecure/finance/mutual-funds
→ Add a fund to whitelist/blacklist 

PUT    /finsecure/finance/mutual-funds/{id}/status
→ Update fund status (WHITELISTED / BLACKLISTED) 

GET    /finsecure/finance/mutual-funds/{id}
→ Get fund by ID 

GET    /finsecure/finance/mutual-funds?page=0&size=10&status=&category=
→ Get all funds with pagination, optional status and category filter 


 Employee Bank Accounts —
/finsecure/finance/bank-accounts  
/finsecure/employee/bank-accounts

POST   /finsecure/employee/bank-accounts
→ Employee submits their bank account 

GET    /finsecure/employee/bank-accounts/my
→ Employee views their own bank account 

PUT    /finsecure/finance/bank-accounts/{id}/status
→ Finance approves/rejects (PENDING / APPROVED / REJECTED) 

GET    /finsecure/finance/bank-accounts/{id}
→ Finance gets one account by ID 

GET    /finsecure/finance/bank-accounts?page=0&size=10&status=
→ Finance gets all accounts with optional status filter 


 Employee Investments —
/finsecure/employee/investments  
/finsecure/finance/investments

POST   /finsecure/employee/investments
→ Employee declares an investment (mutual fund / equity / bonds) 

GET    /finsecure/employee/investments/my
→ Employee views their own investments 

PUT    /finsecure/finance/investments/{id}/review
→ Finance reviews (COMPLIANT / NON_COMPLIANT) 

GET    /finsecure/finance/investments?page=0&size=10&status=
→ Finance gets all investments with optional compliance status filter 


 Employee Cards — /finsecure/finance/cards

POST   /finsecure/finance/cards
→ Issue a card to an employee 

PUT    /finsecure/finance/cards/{id}/status
→ Block / unblock / expire a card 

GET    /finsecure/finance/cards/employee/{employeeId}
→ Get all cards for a specific employee 

GET    /finsecure/employee/cards/my
→ Employee views their own cards (EMPLOYEE)


 Salary — /finsecure/finance/salary

POST   /finsecure/finance/salary/jobs
→ Schedule a salary job for a target month 

GET    /finsecure/finance/salary/jobs
→ Get all salary jobs with status 

GET    /finsecure/finance/salary/records?employeeId=&month=
→ Get salary records with optional filters 

GET    /finsecure/employee/salary/my
→ Employee views their own salary records 


 Reports — /finsecure/finance/reports

GET    /finsecure/finance/reports/salary-summary?month=
→ Salary summary report for a given month 

GET    /finsecure/finance/reports/investment-compliance
→ Investment compliance report 

GET    /finsecure/finance/reports/bank-validation
→ Bank validation status report 


